 for my own use. You can get it below if it's of any interest to anybody.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5361-nicebrian","user":"NiceBrian","date":".  Removing filthy 4shared links. 03-27-2015, 05:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5361-nicebrian","name":"NiceBrian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5361_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T08:20:19-07:00","id":459018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NiceBrian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/456981-character-sheets-by-mrgone?p=457862#post457862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm no MrGone, but I did put together an excel character sheet for my own use. You can get it here if it's of any interest to anybody.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.4shared.com/file/b-dCxCp0ce/WtF-2E-CharacterSheet.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.4shared.com/file/b-dCxCp0...cterSheet.html</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Apologies, I've tried editing but it won't let me get rid of the link below, use the one above.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Thanks for the link, but 4shared wants to steal all my personal information and startle my dog. I don't have a spare garbage account for any of those services they offered to plunder. Can you share a link from Dropbox or Google Drive?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T08:24:03-07:00","id":459021,"title":"","content":"Yeah, 4shared is terrible and should not be used by anyone. It is rampant with piracy and malware.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T14:57:49-07:00","id":459412,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I didn't really think that through, it was free and easy... and that's the start of many moral tales.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I took a little time to do things right this time. You can now find a zip file at the link below, containing the excel file.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.nicebrian.com/Download/WtF-2E-CharacterSheet.zip\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.nicebrian.com/Download/Wt...acterSheet.zip</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5361-nicebrian","name":"NiceBrian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5361_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T15:01:41-07:00","id":459414,"title":"","content":"No worries. Thanks for putting it up elsewhere!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T15:34:10-07:00","id":459445,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Thanks Brian, you're nice! Checking it out... shortly!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T01:29:47-07:00","id":459756,"title":"","content":"Hey, when opening the file, it asks if I want to update the links to other files. What links are those? Are they page number links to the pdf if you have it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5292,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","user":"FlailBot","date":".  First sentence wasn't actually a question. 03-28-2015, 04:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T03:56:22-07:00","id":459807,"title":"","content":"Oh and a few notes, Brian:<br /> Gauru doesn't give 1/1 armor.<br /> Your speed calculation is based on Size, which is accurate for other WoD books, but WW is explicitly based on species factor. See p.158.<br /> I think that you attack calculations are wrong, since e.g. the +2 lethal from claws or bite are added as flat damage after a successful attack, but you have those bonuses included in the attack calc. So, a claw attack in Dalu would be (Dalu.Str + Brawl - Defense) and on a success you would deal successes + 1 lethal damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5292,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","user":"FlailBot","date":". 03-28-2015, 07:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T08:57:04-07:00","id":460057,"title":"","content":"I have a good looking sheet but have no idea how to host it, anyone got any advice on getting it out? I can e-mail it if y'all wanna shoot me some DMs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T09:47:30-07:00","id":460099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FlailBot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/456981-character-sheets-by-mrgone?p=459807#post459807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh and a few notes, Brian:<br /> Gauru doesn't give 1/1 armor.<br /> Your speed calculation is based on Size, which is accurate for other WoD books, but WW is explicitly based on species factor. See p.158.<br /> I think that you attack calculations are wrong, since e.g. the +2 lethal from claws or bite are added as flat damage after a successful attack, but you have those bonuses included in the attack calc. So, a claw attack in Dalu would be (Dalu.Str + Brawl - Defense) and on a success you would deal successes + 1 lethal damage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. I meant to correct the gauru armor as I saw that correction on another thread here. I'll double check and correct the other bits too and get a corrected version up soon. (I'll add a note here once I've updated it).<br /> <br /> Thanks for the feedback, it'll help me iron out mistakes and make sure I avoid them in my own game.<br /> <br /> Gnomish, it was suggested earlier that Dropbox or Google Drive might be good for hosting (I don't actually have either so I can't recommend), if you are stuck you can send the sheet on to me and I'll host it on my webspace (I can't gaurantee long term hosting though).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5361-nicebrian","name":"NiceBrian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5361_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T09:49:18-07:00","id":460101,"title":"","content":"Hello! I'm a little late to the party...but... I have been asked to make by OP to update the sheets. I finished them and sent them off. Not sure when they'll be releasing them though. Hopefully soon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And people can always feel free to email or message me","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T12:38:09-07:00","id":460304,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Everyone in this thread is a hero.<br /> <br /> Brian, when I'm back on my machine I'll send you the updated cells I used for the attack calculation. Would also be cool to add support for fighting finesse, but I expect that is a little complicated.<br /> <br /> Oh and one last suggestion, more space for the page references so that a book can be specified by 3 letter code, e.g. If I get a merit out of GMC.<br /> <br /> @Gnomish: Dropbox and drive both allow for links to hosted content and are free. If you've got a Google account, drive is pretty cool.<br /> <br /> @Mr gone: good to hear! I look forward to seeing the results.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> @Brian: =CONCATENATE(AX$4+$I$28-IF($I$28&lt;1;1;0);&quot;+&quot;;AW17;&quot;L&quot;)<br /> is the gauru claw attack. It outputs something like &quot;9+2L&quot; i.e. dice amount and then damage bonus and type.<br /> Other notes: You have Harmony starting at a default of 6, not 7, and the nice pretty lines should probably be surrounding 4, 5, 6 not 5-7.<br /> I'd capitalize &quot;Fear,&quot; &quot;Prey,&quot; &quot;Down,&quot; and &quot;Firearms&quot; from the forms section, for aesthetics.<br /> Oh, and I widened the boxes for the attack values. Consequently the Health and Willpower bars look a little silly, but I don't know enough to fix that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5292,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","user":"FlailBot","date":". 03-28-2015, 04:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T13:51:56-07:00","id":460392,"title":"","content":"I've updated the sheet on my link now to how I believe the calculations should be (thanks to FlailBot's keen eye). <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Rather than referencing size, basic speed is now calculated from a flat 5 (human species factor), the modifications in the different forms should still hold up.</li> <li>I removed the Armor section of the forms as there is no adjustments there.</li> <li>I removed the reference to Attack(Bite) and Attack(Claw) and replaced them with Damage(Bite) and Damage(Claw) as this seemed the easiest solution, and simply listed the different damage levels per form.</li> </ol><br /> I also changed the order of the &quot;page&quot; and &quot;dots&quot; columns in the Merits section so this should allow more room for including book codes such as GMC. I actually do this myself so I'm not sure why I didn't switch the order of these before.<br /> <br /> I'm glad you find the sheet useful enough to be worth fixing, if nothing else you made sure my own personal resources are better and for that I am thankful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5361-nicebrian","name":"NiceBrian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5361_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T14:03:14-07:00","id":460400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FlailBot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/456981-character-sheets-by-mrgone?p=460304#post460304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Mr gone: good to hear! I look forward to seeing the results.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hopefully you'll like it...and hopefully they'll release it soon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http